WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,070 --> 00:00:03,310
Hey, I, my headache is fine.

2
00:00:03,310 --> 00:00:04,510
I was feeling dizzy just now

3
00:00:04,510 --> 00:00:05,870
Now I don’t feel dizzy at all

4
00:00:05,870 --> 00:00:08,750
The business in my ears is gone.

5
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:14,660
It was a real hardship along the way.

6
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:16,180
I'm starving

7
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:19,346
food

8
00:00:19,346 --> 00:00:27,260
There's something to eat again

9
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:31,040
Brother Lin, how do you divide it?

10
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:32,780
Except sex water

11
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:35,220
The rest will be distributed according to the old rules

12
00:00:35,220 --> 00:00:45,790
survivor

13
00:00:45,790 --> 00:00:47,740
If you see this letter

14
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:50,640
It means you have entered a safe place

15
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:53,250
This is an abandoned place

16
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:55,250
we call it the lost world
